From 16d877cd079ef347cb628bcf881343cdb20d5643 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (architect)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:35:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rooms (#71): manifest schema, pilot room, GET /v1/rooms with
 agent-mail proof

A meeting room is rooms/<project>.json validated against
registry/districts.json and registry/agents.yaml: the reviewer is a
standing member and can never chair, the approver is named, bad
manifests are reported with their file name. GET /v1/rooms (behind the
gateway bearer) serves each room with only what agent-mail proves:
not_configured until AGENT_MAIL_URL is set, unreachable with its error,
members only when agent-mail lists them; message counts stay null
until a thread read exists. Pilot room: foundry-computer (production).
JSON, not YAML: the repo has no YAML parser and the registry is JSON.
Agent-mail deployment on the server stays owner-gated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
